capability tables/version  the version of Unicode the tables hold
  heroes  unicode.UNICODE_VERSION
  go      unicode.Version
  rust    char::UNICODE_VERSION, std::char::UNICODE_VERSION
  python  unicodedata.unidata_version
  note    the tables are Python 3.15.2's unicodedata, 17.0.0, as Go 1.27.3's are; Rust 1.100 holds 18.0.0: over every scalar value its is_alphabetic differs on 12,833 code points, all unassigned in 17.0.0, and its to_uppercase on 21, four of them assigned (U+0277, U+027C, U+AB4B, U+AB4C); on the 297,334 code points assigned in 17.0.0 its is_lowercase, is_uppercase, is_numeric and to_lowercase agree with these tables

